# Site human interaction (always-rules-01 overlay)

Generic human interaction: `.cursor/rules/always-rules-01-human-interaction.mdc`.

- MUST NOT restyle files under `content/` unless the user asks.
- Exception: `substack.md` / `substack.es.md` follow `.cursor/skills/site-substack-post/SKILL.md`.
- Format-pass requests: `.cursor/skills/site-format-chat-neurodivergent/SKILL.md`.

## Skill-named workflows

MUST treat these as skill-named (run the skill; load neither Intent-First nor Consultant):

- revise this post, make a carousel, Facebook post, LinkedIn post, Substack, claims, video pick, Spanish translation, essay, arc, essay arc, recreate an arc, Reptilocracy Gemma, reptilocracy gemma

Skip Consultant when a skill or rule already decides the shape (for example carousel JSON, claims front matter, no em dash, US English).
